Z||000014||Formula88||10-29-2001||02:02 PM||||Oh, if you're looking for a BRAND NEW 3800SC, check here: <A HREF="http://www.southfloridapulleyhq.com/gtp_products_frame.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.southfloridapulleyhq.com/gtp_products_frame.htm</A> <BR>Scroll down and click on "New Complete L67 Engine."  Be warned that this engine doesn't come with accessories, so you'll still have to source those from a boneyard, but you get a brand new engine.  <P>I'm thinking - get a setup out of a wrecked GTP with blown engine, and put it's accessories ane ECM on the new engine.  You can save money with a used engine - but if you want brand new - here's an option.||||reg||1
